     9                          ;
    10                          ; ACIA 6850 interrupt driven serial I/O to run modified NASCOM Basic 4.7.
    11                          ; Full input and output buffering with incoming data hardware handshaking.
    12                          ; Handshake shows full before the buffer is totally filled to allow run-on
    13                          ; from the sender. Transmit and receive are interrupt driven.
    14                          ; 115200 baud, 8n2
    15                          ;
    16                          ; feilipu, August 2020
    17                          ;
