    12                          ;
    13                          ; ACIA 68B50 interrupt driven serial I/O to run modified NASCOM Basic 4.7.
    14                          ; Full input and output buffering with incoming data hardware handshaking.
    15                          ; Handshake shows full before the buffer is totally filled to
    16                          ; allow run-on from the sender. Transmit and receive are interrupt driven.
    17                          ;
    18                          ; https://github.com/feilipu/
    19                          ; https://feilipu.me/
